Package: tizenos-desktop
Architecture: all
Depends: tizenos-core, tizenos-gpu-common, tizenos-shell, tizenos-settings,
         tizenos-app-framework, tizenos-package-manager, tizenos-multimedia,
         systemd, dbus, networkmanager, pipewire, wireplumber,
         greetd, xwayland, fonts-noto
Description: TizenOS Desktop Environment (meta-package)
 Complete TizenOS desktop including Wayland compositor, panel, launcher,
 settings, and all core services.

Package: tizenos-core
Architecture: all
Depends: tizenos-gpu-common, libtizen-core, libtizen-dbus,
         tizenos-security-manager, tizenos-cynara
Description: TizenOS Core System (meta-package)
 Core components and libraries for TizenOS.

Package: tizenos-minimal
Architecture: all 
Depends: tizenos-gpu-common, systemd, dbus, apt
Description: TizenOS Minimal System (meta-package)
 Bare minimum TizenOS with GPU detection, no GUI.

Package: tizenos-nvidia
Architecture: all
Depends: tizenos-gpu-nvidia, nvidia-driver
Recommends: nvidia-settings, nvidia-vaapi-driver
Description: TizenOS NVIDIA Support (meta-package)
 Meta-package to pull in NVIDIA proprietary drivers and related tools.

